<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Healthcare started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it started coverage of United Healthcare Corp with a near-term rating of market perform.</p>
<p>-- Set initial long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 43-7/8.</p>
</text>
